# Flutter Feature Architecture

- Build business features under `lib/features/<feature>/` with `data`, `domain`, and `presentation` layers.
- Keep dependency direction strict: `presentation -> domain`, `data -> domain`, `domain -> nothing`.
- Put repository contracts in `domain/repositories` and implementations in `data/repositories`.
- Keep infrastructure (`ApiClient`, remote config, package info, storage services) inside the data layer.
- Convert data through `JSON -> Model -> Mapper -> Entity`; do not expose raw API maps to presentation.
- Return `EitherResponseOrException<T>` from repositories and wrap network calls with `safeNetworkCall(...)`.
- Keep screens/widgets free of data-access logic; they should trigger notifier actions and render state.
